title: "[Beslisboom] ThrowAsyncPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q0: "In een AssertionScope?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Direct geawaite statement?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Awaiting: TryGetAction lukt, anders geen FA-subject;\nFunc<Task> of Func<Task<ref type>>?" {shape: diamond}
qa: "ThrowExactlyAsync, of geen\nAggregateException-risico?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "Named args, of becauseArgs\nbij niet-constante because?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "WithMessage?" {shape: diamond}
q7: "Constante, alleen voor-/achter-*,\ngeen regeleinde naast *?" {shape: diamond}
q0 -> q3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> qa: ja
qa -> q5: ja
q5 -> q6: nee
q6 -> q7: ja
m0: "Manual: Inside an AssertionScope\n(geen eigen proof)"
m3: "Manual: not directly awaited / is used\n(no-await, where, value-used)"
m4: "Manual: Awaiting-receiver/lambda, FA-subject / reference type\n(Invoking/*, value-func)"
ma: "Manual: unwraps AggregateException\n(aggregate-result)"
m5: "Manual: named arguments or becauseArgs\n(geen proof)"
m7: "Manual: not a string constant / wildcards other than / line break\n(message-variable, message-wildcard, message-contains-line-break)"
f1: "Fixed: await Should.ThrowAsync<T>(act[, because])[.ConfigureAwait(..)]\n[(..).ShouldBeOfType<T>() bij ThrowExactlyAsync]\n(simple, func-task-reference, because, because-args,\nedge-configure-await, edge-local-async-lambda, aggregate-awaited)"
f2: "Fixed: (await Should.ThrowAsync<T>(act)).Message.ShouldX(...)\n(message-contains, -starts, -ends, -exact, -because,\n-because-args, -line-break)"
q0 -> m0: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q4 -> m4: nee
qa -> ma: nee
q5 -> m5: ja
q6 -> f1: nee
q7 -> m7: nee
q7 -> f2: ja
